@Izaak: If you have a solution other than "rewrite VTES" on how to do that... I'm sure there a plenty of Princes who would be interested to read those ideas. If your ideas are basically "you all suck" then I don't think much else you write beyond that will get listened to.

If you don't think your Prince is doing enough of a job to expand the playgroup or keep it alive, then step up and put your deeds behind your words and help out your local Prince. If you don't have a local Prince, then step up and do the job and show us all how it is done better.

Retired Baron of Sydney, Australia, 418
